## 3. IMPORTANT: SAVE GAME DATA

Use JavaScript `localStorage`.

The following data must remain saved when the player changes pages:

* Coins
* Flour
* Eggs
* Sugar
* Milk
* Butter
* Donuts
* Bread

For example:

```javascript
localStorage.setItem(...)
localStorage.getItem(...)
```

The player must NOT lose their coins or ingredients when going from:

```text
Bakery
↓
Ingredient Shop
↓
Bakery
```

## 4. DESIGN

Make the game look cute and cozy.

Style:

* Soft bakery aesthetic
* Warm cream/pastel background
* Rounded cards
* Rounded buttons
* Cute emojis
* Simple layout
* Clean readable fonts
* Small hover animation on buttons

Make it responsive so it works on both desktop and mobile.

Do not make the design overly complicated.

## 5. CODE REQUIREMENTS

Make sure:

* `index.html` loads `style.css` and `script.js`
* `ingredients.html` loads `style.css` and `script.js`
* There is no duplicated game-state system
* Use `localStorage` as the single source of saved game data
* Avoid JavaScript errors
* Buttons must actually work
* Page navigation must actually work
* Inventory numbers must update immediately
* Coins must update immediately

